<title>UK: Genfinance sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>Genfinance sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BGL and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINACE LUX SA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GENERALE BANK (RATED A1)  AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    10.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> YIELD	5.74 PCT  DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
